                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Tried Gravity Sketch, Room Designer VR etc. My needs aren't esoteric, I want a VR program that will allow me to visualize projects like renovating a bathroom or building an outside area. Nothing i've tried on the Vive so far does this.\n  This has a UI that's easy to understand, primitives that are simple to scale and a ruler. Yes, there's more but those simple things are all i need and this is the first VR design app that's allowed me to throw together a room quickly.\n  I didn't experience any glitches despite EA status (using 1080/6700k), the dev responds quickly and has made it clear the features to be prioritized in  future updates. \n  My criticism would be that there aren't tutorial files but i note the dev has uploaded a video today that addresses this issue. \n  There are features (ie: collaborative) that i'm personally unlikely to use at the moment because i'm too busy building things in the real world but look forward to added usability. Recommended.",
